            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "刷新access_token有效期"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "       access_token是调用授权关系接口的调用凭证，由于access_token有效期（目前默认为2个小时）较短，当access_token超时后，可以使用refresh_token进行刷新，access_token刷新结果有两种："
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "        1. 若access_token已超时，那么进行refresh_token会获取一个新的access_token，新的refresh_token，新的超时时间；"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "        2. 若access_token未超时，那么进行refresh_token不会改变access_token，但超时时间会刷新，相当于续期access_token。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "        refresh_token拥有较长的有效期（默认为24小时），当refresh_token失效后，需要用户重新授权。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
